Subject: [PATCH 17/17] F1 help: Apple II PC keys and wording

The help screen lists the keys the boot image adds (volume, display
settings, monitor shape, removing disks, save slots, F12 asking before
power-off) with an Apple II PC header, and fits the line spacing to the
number of lines. The terminal frontend leaves the SDL 1 only keys out.
---
 src/frontends/common/HelpText.h | 113 ++++++++++++++------------------
 src/frontends/sdl1/Frame.cpp    |   6 +-
 src/frontends/tui/TuiVideo.cpp  |   7 +-
 3 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

